{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1155.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"fd5b18685d17bb50b140b6b18c8247c2c3b637965f06d299e1d3a5d23e4a947f","ja":"ふぅ～。お仕事が長引いてすっかり\n遅くなっちゃったわね。暗くなる前に帰りましょう。","zh":"呼～工作拖得太久，结果变得\n这么晚了呢。在天黑之前回去吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1155.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"07f2d648a19792762fab381c205f979c15adb35cf8efba2b0fde3cfeb95dbb21","ja":"うん！　夜は危ないもんね……あれっ？","zh":"嗯！晚上确实很危险呢……咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1155.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"513bd8143ba899f4022fd93857378fbcefd29abbca63ca74005b4422060c4055","ja":"茜ちゃんだ……どうしたんだろう？\nなんだか、コソコソしてるみたいに見えたけど……。","zh":"是小茜啊……怎么了吗？\n总觉得，看上去鬼鬼祟祟的……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1155.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d03eb2c74daafb881b93e8bb406b5693d34da2663574ddf69321e42fc0e89c70","ja":"そうね……お家に帰るって感じでもなさそうだし、\nこんな時間にどこに行くのかしら……？","zh":"也是呢……看起来也不像是要回家，\n这个时间是要去哪里呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1155.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8ecbbe0372f668e486157409b9641cf5d3a129e43b040cf091f346f567e11509","ja":"危ないことをしようとしてるのかも……！\nそれなら止めてあげなくちゃ！","zh":"可能打算去做危险的事……！\n那样的话就必须去阻止才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1155.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a8449e976397d21a4a1b4213ae5acac0142ed86af3fb618b396c84caf8aa18d5","ja":"えっ、育ちゃん！？　ちょ、ちょっと待って……！","zh":"诶，小育！？等、等等……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1155.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"3c11b706380eb93fc2bce1d1cf4fd1971ed96862808aafc08e6af1c3d4158889","ja":"見失っちゃったわね。\nこのあたりに来てたと思うんだけど……。","zh":"跟丢了呢。\n明明觉得是来到这附近了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1155.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"f7359298c3cffb79721dfa4f9628d249d68c44d503e4cd4b59feecc04955fb38","ja":"やっぱり、誰かについてこられないように\nしてるのかな……。","zh":"难道真的是为了不让人\n跟上来吗……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1155.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"3edecd85424a685eba473677b891a693c98067a181f2d9e60a24177fb41c87a5","ja":"あっ、待って。\nどこからか、茜ちゃんの声が……？","zh":"啊，等等。\n好像从哪里传来了小茜的声音……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
